  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5607.01 Obtaining an 'Opt-Out'",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5607.01 Obtaining an 'Opt-Out'.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 260:14, any person may request that the department not release their motor vehicle records for the purposes specified in RSA 260:14, V(a)(1)-(7) by completing form DSMV 506.\n\n(b) A person who requests an opt out shall also request a waiver from providing a social security number as specified by RSA 263:40-a.\n\n(c) The department is prohibited from granting the waiver in (b), above, to commercial driver licensees as specified in RSA 263:90.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
}
